{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 確認 iCloud、Find My 等多項服務持續中斷。Apple 系統狀態網頁顯示，相關中斷約於美國東部時間下午 5 時 49 分、太平洋時間下午 2 時 49 分開始。</p>\n<h2>Apple 多項服務中斷</h2>\n<p>Apple 系統狀態網頁列出，出現中斷的服務包括 iCloud 日曆、iCloud 聯絡人、iCloud 郵件、iWork for iCloud 及 Game Center。Apple 又表示，Find My 可能「變慢或無法使用」，但未將其列作全面中斷。</p>\n<p>在社交媒體快速搜尋可見，有 iCloud 用戶投訴無法經 iCloud 收發郵件、無法登入 Apple Account，部分人更表示已被登出 Apple Account。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Find My 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/findmy.jpg\" width=\"1074\"/></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/support/systemstatus/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:29:16.046750+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:09:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:23.757037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:22:53.010227+00:00","content_hash":"898f00d599989bd818830fa03543e8ad1ab0d4a12db91f646f2a68d8a46474c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}